     authored topology are both satisfied.
  🟢 Worth noting against T43863: PIM-SM lost 1-2 frames per group to the Register/tree build;
     **PIM-DM lost none** on a warm bench, because dense mode floods first and asks later.
  VERDICT legs 2/3: PASS (the authored step).

